# 📝 TOEIC Part 5 - Day32

## Question 1

The employee _____ manages the department has worked here for ten years.

A. who
B. which
C. where
D. what

Answer: A

→ 사람(employee)
→ 관계대명사 + 동사
→ who

---

## Question 2

The computer _____ I purchased last month is already broken.

A. who
B. where
C. which
D. when

Answer: C

→ 사물(computer)
→ I = 주어
→ which = 목적어

---

## Question 3

The company _____ provides this service has expanded rapidly.

A. who
B. which
C. where
D. when

Answer: B

---

## Question 4

The applicant _____ we interviewed yesterday had excellent qualifications.

A. which
B. where
C. who
D. when

Answer: C

→ 사람(applicant)
→ we = 주어
→ who = 목적어

---

## Challenge

The office _____ we held the meeting was renovated last year.

A. who
B. which
C. where
D. what

Answer: C

→ office = 장소
→ where = 그곳에서

---

## Key Point

### 사람

who

### 사물

which

### 장소

where

### 시간

when

---

## 기억하기

관계대명사 뒤를 확인한다.

who + 동사

who + 주어 + 동사

which + 동사

which + 주어 + 동사
